== wrap | 40 | - | @commit.txt
  |Fix the off-by-one in the ring buffer's|
  |wrap-around logic -- the reader could|
  |observe a half-written slot when the|
  |writer lapped it. This affects every|
  |multi-producer queue built on top of it,|
  |e.g. the log shipper and the metrics|
  |pipeline.  See|
  |https://example.org/issues/4711-ring-|
  |buffer-wraparound-race for the full|
  |write-up.  Reviewed-by: A. N. Other|
  |<another@example.org>|
(11 lines)
== wrap | 72 | fse=1 | @commit.txt
  |Fix the off-by-one in the ring buffer's wrap-around logic -- the reader|
  |could observe a half-written slot when the writer lapped it.  This|
  |affects every multi-producer queue built on top of it, e.g.  the log|
  |shipper and the metrics pipeline.  See|
  |https://example.org/issues/4711-ring-buffer-wraparound-race for the full|
  |write-up.  Reviewed-by: A. N. Other <another@example.org>|
