== wrap | 50 | ii=- ,si=  ,boh=0 | @notes.md
  |- Kāra's ownership model has three tiers: owned|
  |  values, borrowed references and|
  |  reference-counted shared values. Most code never|
  |  needs the third.  A long identifier like configu|
  |  ration_loader_with_environment_overrides_and_def|
  |  aults does not fit on one line, nor does https:/|
  |  /docs.example.org/very/long/path/to/a/page.html|
  |  at all.  Distances are written 10¤km and 2¤h;|
  |  the no-break space keeps each pair together.|
  |  Café, naïve and façade are words too.  Short.|
